<view class="container page-bg">
  <view class="hero-strip glass-card">
    <text class="eyebrow">TRAVEL PLANNER</text>
    <text class="title">今天怎么出发</text>
    <text class="subtitle">选一个入口，直接开始。</text>
    <view class="hero-meta">
      <text class="hero-chip">城市背景会跟着目的地切换</text>
      <text class="hero-chip">偏好图片已按旅行场景重做</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="entry-stage">
    <view class="entry-card entry-plan glass-card" bindtap="goToPlan">
      <view class="entry-head">
        <text class="entry-mark">PLAN</text>
        <text class="entry-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
      <view class="entry-body">
        <text class="entry-title">行程规划</text>
        <text class="entry-desc">已经想好去哪，就把路线和节奏安排清楚。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="entry-tags">
        <text class="entry-tag">目的地已确定</text>
        <text class="entry-tag">适合直接开做</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="entry-card entry-discover glass-card" bindtap="goToDiscover">
      <view class="entry-head">
        <text class="entry-mark">RND</text>
        <text class="entry-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
      <view class="entry-body">
        <text class="entry-title">随机玩</text>
        <text class="entry-desc">还没想好去哪，就先拿几组灵感方案。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="entry-tags">
        <text class="entry-tag entry-tag-warm">周末灵感</text>
        <text class="entry-tag entry-tag-warm">按预算筛选</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="home-notes">
    <text class="home-note">目的地选择支持到区县</text>
    <text class="home-note">轻松度假、网红打卡、美食等偏好可组合</text>
  </view>
</view>
